{"sourceUrl":"http://csee.hnu.edu.cn/info/1062/13737.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:10.624647+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://csee.hnu.edu.cn/info/1062/13737.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>湖南大学</span></span><span><span>信息科学与工程学院</span></span><span><span>竭诚欢迎全国各高校优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免试来我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>攻读研究生。为做好</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）接收工作，现将预报名有关事宜通知如下。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>届我院招生专业相关的普通全日制本科毕业生，有望取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>.身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、招生专业</span></span></p>\n<div>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/8b68bc2468b898b2bb3e.png\"/><span><br/></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span><span>我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>硕士研究生基本</span></span><span><span>学制</span></span><span><span>为</span><span>3年</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>直博生基本</span></span><span><span>学制</span></span><span><span>为</span><span>5年，</span></span><span><span>具体以当年度专业培养方案为准</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、申请</span></span><span><span>流程</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.申请人可于7月</span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>日之后登录</span></span><a href=\"https://yjszsxt.hnu.edu.cn/zsxt2026/tmsgl/default.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>湖南</span></span><span><span>大学接收推免生报名信息采集系统</span></span></a><span>，</span><span>填写有关信息、上传附件材料并提交申请。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.学院将根据上级政策开展考核选拔工作，</span></span><span><span>具体时间及工作安排请关注学院通知</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>申请人须在</span></span><span><span>“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”</span></span><span><span>正式报名，</span></span><span><span>完成填报志愿、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>、申请</span></span><span><span>材料</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人将以</span></span><span><span>下</span></span><span><span>材料按照</span><span>1-</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>项顺序整理成一个</span><span>PDF文件（</span></span><span><span>A4纵向版面，内容清晰，文件大小</span></span><span><span>不超过</span><span>10M）</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>上传推免生报名信息采集系统。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>简历</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>不超过</span><span>1页A4</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>身份证</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>学生证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>.本科成绩单(由教务处盖章或</span></span><span><span>所在</span></span><span><span>学院盖章</span><span>)</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.本科</span></span><span><span>总评成绩排名证明</span><span>(由教务处盖章或</span></span><span><span>所在</span></span><span><span>学院盖章</span><span>)；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>.英语水平证明材料（CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS等成绩单）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>.学术科研成果（公开发表的论文等）和获奖证书；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>.参加社会实践、公益事业等的证明材料；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>.其他可反映自身能力和水平的相关材料。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>注意事项</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.我校推免生报名信息采集系统中的招生专业仅供参考，具体推免生招生专业以公布的202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年研究生推免招生专业目录为准，最终录取专业以</span><span>“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”中录取确认为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.直接攻读博士研究生招生专业、导师名单可参考《湖南大学202</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年博士研究生招生专业目录》，申请人应提前与报考导师联系并征得同意。如对招生专业、报考博导等信息有疑问，可在报名阶段咨询学院。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>.申请人应保证填报信息</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>申请</span></span><span><span>材料的真实性和准确性。对于提供虚假报考信息或不符合申请条件的考生，一经查实，取消</span></span><span><span>申请资格、</span></span><span><span>考核资格等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>.学校和学院202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年接收推免生招生</span></span><span><span>相关</span></span><span><span>信息</span></span><span><span>将及时公布</span></span><span><span>在湖南大学研究生院网站（</span><span>http://gra.hnu.edu.cn/）、湖南大学</span></span><span><span>信息科学与工程</span></span><span><span>学院网站（</span><span>http://</span></span><span><span>csee</span></span><span><span>.hnu.edu.cn/），请密切关注。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>咨询和</span></span><span><span>联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>地址：湖南省长沙市岳麓区湖南大学</span></span><span><span>信息科学与工程</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span><span><span>202办公室</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电话：</span><span>0731-8882</span></span><span><span>1776</span></span><span><span> </span></span><span><span>李</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮箱：</span><span>xkyzb@hnu.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"79881d8a9a92a2cc252e9e98557882664fe2776886c93b0a3574a1e0c47dc39c","textLength":1163,"sourceSha256":"b7ee52146b523ab1c47d284b5c011ab08e98dc7bc4834cad7de861073969d178","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c53ac4e6ad736ce7e06b","title":"2025年湖南大学信息科学与工程学院2026年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:10.624647+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://csee.hnu.edu.cn/__local/0/02/44/CEC09634987D923364B5E785344_CE3C4B2A_9BE0.png","file":"assets/articles/media/8b68bc2468b898b2bb3e.png"}]}
